### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### OfflinePay — End-to-End Manual Test Collection
### Works in IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client) and VS Code (REST Client).
###
### SETUP BEFORE RUNNING (see Testing Guide):
###   1. docker compose up -d          -> Kafka :9092 + Redis :6379 healthy
###   2. .\set-env.ps1                 -> Supabase + queue creds
###   3. Set JWT_SECRET and JWT_PUBLIC_KEY (see .env.example)
###   4. Boot the 4 services (ports 8081-8084) and the gateway (8080)
###   5. Paste the RS256 session JWT below into {{sessionToken}}
###
### Run top-to-bottom. After Step 2, copy the `token` value from its response
### into {{offlineToken}} (used by Steps 4-6, 9, N5, N6).
### Note: the response does NOT include `reservationId` — it is not used by any
### request in this file, so you can leave {{reservationId}} as-is.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@base_gateway = http://localhost:8080
@base_token   = http://localhost:8081
@base_ledger  = http://localhost:8082
@base_sync    = http://localhost:8083
@base_fraud   = http://localhost:8084

@userId = user_abc123
@sessionToken = eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ1c2VyX2FiYzEyMyIsInJvbGUiOiJVU0VSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg1Njk5MjI0LCJleHAiOjE3ODU3ODU2MjR9.pZIDb6KI6rgqHMqaBfquQRRnBjGNjWJr0jhSRL_VowipM5NivEPh_fQHzKHMJhNMpN0DCz9oOowCxLJQZwQnpjPb9fDPNUTzEceec12QoK0MIyOKHdJ2SqXrPS0WNhSXaQ_ekyf8t0p_GUEcYHlBWqhcJPD2w41ZeNnC11Y2hW0E75eZxLmH4KYxbcIX2X8KFyksGyMaLnH67uuutDBl4A-4R_8K9MFA6ZiSWqtkFN4QKM-HZff3XITT2VZA648idv3UUqxRmg8F91EczKwEXCoELqFrpr07M_c5-w5yvUg_GtCTATaf0FCX_MEWX6nM8BU0TFUbcmyOQDiguIyaqg
